        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Blackjack is a focused single-player blackjack simulator built to feel like a real casino table – without ads, gimmicks, or real-money gambling.<br>Drag chips into the betting circles, play up to three hands, and enjoy natural pacing with clear dealer voice lines and clean animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎰 <strong>True casino rules</strong> – Blackjack pays 3:2, dealer hits soft 17 (H17), insurance, split and double down on hard 9, 10, 11, up to two splits, double after split, and one card on split aces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 <strong>Deck &amp; shuffle options</strong> – Choose 1, 6, or 8 decks. Each shoe is built and shuffled with a standard unbiased Fisher–Yates shuffle, then dealt in order with no rigging or rubber-banding. A clear shuffle banner lets you know when a new shoe starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Clear table information</strong> – Session goal and current session total shown at the top, plus Decks / Count / True Count for players who like to track the shoe. On-table reminders show “BLACKJACK PAYS 3 TO 2”, “DEALER MUST HIT SOFT 17”, and “INSURANCE PAYS 2 TO 1”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Authentic chip handling</strong> – Drag chips into the betting circles, play up to three hands at once, and watch winning, losing, and push results resolve with smooth chip animations. Blackjack pays true 3:2 using a dedicated $2.50 chip for fractional payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧾 <strong>Insurance made clear</strong> – When the dealer shows an ace, an insurance banner and on-table explanation text make it obvious what you’re choosing and how it affects the whole table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎓 <strong>Helpful onboarding</strong> – First-time tips show how to drag chips, place bets, and understand key table options so new players can get comfortable quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements &amp; progression</strong> – Unlock Steam achievements for milestones, streaks, and playtime. Designed for both short breaks and longer sessions at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Audio &amp; presentation</strong> – Casino ambience, chip sounds, shuffle effects, and dealer voice lines such as “Blackjack” and “Place your bets” keep the game feeling alive without being over the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚫 <strong>No real-money gambling</strong> – Classic Blackjack is a pure single-player simulation. There are no real-money bets, no microtransactions, and no ads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to sharpen your skills even further, you can add the optional <strong>Blackjack Trainer: Initial Deal</strong> DLC, which overlays training guidance on top of the same Classic Blackjack table (sold separately).</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Blackjack is a focused single-player blackjack simulator built to feel like a real casino table – without ads, gimmicks, or real-money gambling.<br>Drag chips into the betting circles, play up to three hands, and enjoy natural pacing with clear dealer voice lines and clean animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎰 <strong>True casino rules</strong> – Blackjack pays 3:2, dealer hits soft 17 (H17), insurance, split and double down on hard 9, 10, 11, up to two splits, double after split, and one card on split aces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 <strong>Deck &amp; shuffle options</strong> – Choose 1, 6, or 8 decks. Each shoe is built and shuffled with a standard unbiased Fisher–Yates shuffle, then dealt in order with no rigging or rubber-banding. A clear shuffle banner lets you know when a new shoe starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Clear table information</strong> – Session goal and current session total shown at the top, plus Decks / Count / True Count for players who like to track the shoe. On-table reminders show “BLACKJACK PAYS 3 TO 2”, “DEALER MUST HIT SOFT 17”, and “INSURANCE PAYS 2 TO 1”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Authentic chip handling</strong> – Drag chips into the betting circles, play up to three hands at once, and watch winning, losing, and push results resolve with smooth chip animations. Blackjack pays true 3:2 using a dedicated $2.50 chip for fractional payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧾 <strong>Insurance made clear</strong> – When the dealer shows an ace, an insurance banner and on-table explanation text make it obvious what you’re choosing and how it affects the whole table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎓 <strong>Helpful onboarding</strong> – First-time tips show how to drag chips, place bets, and understand key table options so new players can get comfortable quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements &amp; progression</strong> – Unlock Steam achievements for milestones, streaks, and playtime. Designed for both short breaks and longer sessions at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Audio &amp; presentation</strong> – Casino ambience, chip sounds, shuffle effects, and dealer voice lines such as “Blackjack” and “Place your bets” keep the game feeling alive without being over the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚫 <strong>No real-money gambling</strong> – Classic Blackjack is a pure single-player simulation. There are no real-money bets, no microtransactions, and no ads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to sharpen your skills even further, you can add the optional <strong>Blackjack Trainer: Initial Deal</strong> DLC, which overlays training guidance on top of the same Classic Blackjack table (sold separately).</p>",
        "short_description": "Play authentic 1, 6, or 8-deck blackjack with real casino rules, true 3:2 payouts, unbiased Fisher–Yates shuffles, and smooth chip animations. Learn fast, play endlessly, and chase perfect hands in a clean, focused table experience.",
